---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { contact } from '../data/site';
---
<Base title="Privacy policy | Matthew Denton" description="How Matthew Denton collects, uses and protects the details you share through this website, contact forms and Facebook or Instagram lead forms.">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p>
      <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
      <p class="lede">Last updated: 10 November 2026</p>

      <h2>Who I am</h2>
      <p>This website belongs to Matthew Denton, a web designer and Meta ads specialist based in Cape Town, South Africa, working with businesses in South Africa, the United States, the United Kingdom and elsewhere. You can reach me at <a href={`mailto:${contact.email}`}>{contact.email}</a>.</p>

      <h2>What I collect</h2>
      <p>I only collect the details you choose to give me, through the contact form on this site, by email, or through a lead form on Facebook or Instagram. That can include:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>your name, email address and phone number</li>
        <li>your business name and website address</li>
        <li>your answers to short questions about your business and what you need</li>
      </ul>
      <p>This site may also use basic analytics to count visits. That data is not used to identify you.</p>

      <h2>How I use it</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>to reply to your enquiry and send you what you asked for, such as a free website preview</li>
        <li>to arrange a call if you book one</li>
        <li>to send a small number of follow-up messages about your enquiry, which you can stop at any time</li>
      </ul>
      <p>I do not sell, rent or trade your details, and I do not add you to unrelated mailing lists.</p>

      <h2>Who else sees it</h2>
      <p>Your details are stored in my private customer system and may be seen by the one sales partner who helps me follow up on enquiries. I also use trusted services to run my business, such as Meta (Facebook and Instagram lead forms), Google (email), Calendly (call booking), Supabase (secure data storage) and Vercel (website hosting). They only process your details to provide their service.</p>

      <h2>How long I keep it</h2>
      <p>I keep enquiry details for as long as they are useful for our conversation or work together, and no longer than two years after our last contact, unless the law requires otherwise.</p>

      <h2>Your choices</h2>
      <p>You can ask me at any time to see, correct or delete the details I hold about you, or to stop contacting you. Just email <a href={`mailto:${contact.email}`}>{contact.email}</a> and I will act on it within 30 days.</p>

      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>If this policy changes, the new version will be posted on this page with an updated date.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
<style>
  .prose { max-width: 760px; }
  .prose h1 { font-size: var(--step-4); margin: 8px 0 12px; }
  .prose h2 { font-size: var(--step-1); margin: 36px 0 10px; }
  .prose p, .prose li { color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.7; }
  .prose ul { padding-left: 1.2em; display: grid; gap: 6px; margin: 10px 0; }
  .prose a { color: var(--accent); }
</style>
